		{
			dependencies: ["3E7BA0C70B5569D4"]
			description: [
				"The &5&lAssembler Matrix&r and &5&lUltimate Super Assembler Matrix&r are scalable multiblock crafters that combine pattern storage and molecular assembling into one structure."
				""
				"Extended AE also adds:"
				"- &3Infinity Cells&r"
				"- &3Extended Export Bus &rand &3Extended Import Bus&r"
				"- &3Pattern Access Terminal&r"
				"- &3ME Wireless Connector &rand &3ME Wireless Hub &r(single-dimension)"
				"- &3ME Ingredient Buffer&r"
				"- &3Circuit Slicer&r"
				"- &3ME Oversized Interface&r"
				"- &3Extended Inscriber&r"
				""
				"Extended AE Plus adds:"
				"- &5Wireless Transceiver &r(cross-dimension)"
				"- &5Mirror Pattern Provider&r"
				"- &54x–1024x Crafting Accelerators&r"
				"- &5Super Circuit Cutter&r"
				"- &5Ultimate Super Assembler Matrix&r"
